  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UPSkill Digital build social cohesion amongst businesses</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UPSKILL DIGITAL WILL IMPLEMENT A COMPREHENSIVE 12-MONTH DIGITAL SKILLS TRAINING PROGRAM IN PARTNERSHIP WITH GOOGLE AND THE US EMBASSY IN GUINEA. THE PROGRAM WILL DELIVER HANDS-ON WORKSHOPS TO 500 MSMES ACROSS MULTIPLE CITIES IN GUINEA.</narrative>
